 "Q3_null_object_X_hash": {
  "definition": "X_hash(B,beta) = (beta/d)(1/d) log abs(det B) + c * u(B), u(B) = int(sha256(B.tobytes())[:13],16) / 16^13 in [0,1)",
  "why_it_is_a_null_object": "u(B) reads every entry of A and is a cryptographic digest, so it is by construction independent of every geometric property of the lattice: it carries NO usable lattice information. It is the null object of the same shape called for by docs/inventor-protocol.md section 3.",
  "declared_arguments_if_one_had_to_declare_them": "d, k, beta, q, abs(det B), H(B); nuisance held fixed on the fibre: abs(det B)",
  "NOT_PROPOSED_FOR_ADMISSION_ANYWHERE": true,
